{
  "name": "unicorn",
  "_about": "SCULPTED (2026-11-05, docs/engines.md 'the sculpt overlay'): the horse's frame at .95 drawn by the horse's own shapes (mammals/horse.json) scaled to it and refined to an Arabian -- dry fine legs, a smaller muzzle, the face a little dished; white; the mane long and falling to the off side with a shorter row on the near side and a long forelock; a goat's beard under the chin, feathered fetlocks, cloven hooves; the spiral horn from the forehead between the eyes, half a metre long, wound with a ridge three and a half times round SHARP PASS 2 (2026-11-08): the pointed parts -- horn, hornRidge (2 in all) -- are the engine's sharp `horn`s (sharp.js), made from the field shapes they replaced by tools/creaturegen/sharp/ (claws.py, teeth.py, spikes.py, antlers.py, bills.py): rooted in the body, tips pointed; RE-RUN those after this species' generator. (2026-11-08, ears2.py) The EARS (ears2.py): long LEAVES (sharp.js `fin`), narrow at the root and pointed, cupped forward; the roots faired.",
